d95062c1\" id=\"ud95062c1\">：仅输入正文内容，按顺序生成标题。</span></li><li fid=\"u82010126\" data-lake-id=\"u15b2b1e9\" id=\"u15b2b1e9\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ud2ec9fbb\" id=\"ud2ec9fbb\">优势</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u837e8fd5\" id=\"u837e8fd5\">：无需上下文干扰，专注生成目标内容。</span></li><li fid=\"u82010126\" data-lake-id=\"u72956d5d\" id=\"u72956d5d\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u6509fdfe\" id=\"u6509fdfe\">示例</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u4d726361\" id=\"u4d726361\">：</span></li></ul><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E8%BE%93%E5%85%A5%E6%AD%A3%E6%96%87%20%20%5Cntext%20%3D%20%5C%22%E7%A7%91%E5%AD%A6%E5%AE%B6%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0%E6%96%B0%E5%9E%8B%E9%87%8F%E5%AD%90%E6%9D%90%E6%96%99%EF%BC%8C%E5%AF%BC%E7%94%B5%E6%95%88%E7%8E%87%E6%8F%90%E5%8D%87200%25%E3%80%82%5C%22%20%20%5Cn%23%20%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E8%87%AA%E5%9B%9E%E5%BD%92%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%E6%A0%87%E9%A2%98%20%20%5Cntitle%20%3D%20causal_lm.generate(text)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22isr1n%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><ul list=\"u6827feb8\" start=\"3\"><li fid=\"uc0d30ecb\" data-lake-id=\"u5e98d32f\" id=\"u5e98d32f\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u5026b59f\" id=\"u5026b59f\">Prefix LM不适用</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua3f1c936\" id=\"ua3f1c936\">：标题生成仅需当前内容，前缀会引入冗余信息。</span></li></ul><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22iJy07%22%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"c1822661\" id=\"c1822661\"><span data-lake-id=\"udbb5fa2c\" id=\"udbb5fa2c\">三、示例回答</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u8254a72a\" id=\"u8254a72a\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"imag